# PathoFact 2.0's own classifier image: lfdelzam/pathofact2-models tag 1.0 (pushed
# 2026-08-20), built from its conda_envs/pathofact_models_env.yaml -- scikit-learn 1.5.2,
# xgboost 2.1.1, pandas 2.2.2. Those are the versions its pickled models were saved with;
# a newer scikit-learn refuses or misreads the toxin forest.
